{"title": "Find Familiar: Boo", "pageid": 17971, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Boo", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 1 Spells", "Actions", "Summoning actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Find_Familiar_Boo.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Find_Familiar_Boo.webp/300px-Find_Familiar_Boo.webp, /w/images/7/7c/Find_Familiar_Boo.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Find_Familiar_Boo.webp/300px-Find_Familiar_Boo.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Find_Familiar_Boo.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Find Familiar: Boo </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 1  spell</a>. This spell is a special version of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar\" title=\"Find Familiar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp/25px-Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp/38px-Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp/50px-Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp/25px-Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar\" title=\"Find Familiar\">Find Familiar</a> that can only be used by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/25px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/38px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/50px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Minsc\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/25px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\">Minsc</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nSummon your adorable, occasionally violent, and above all faithful companion, Boo.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creature:_Boo\"> Creature: Boo </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div style=\"float: left; margin-bottom: 7px; margin-right: 7px; width: 160px; height: 160px; position: relative\">\n<div style=\"width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: circle(60px); position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boo\" title=\"Boo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/th